## 📡 API Endpoints

### List Models

```
GET /models
```

Returns all installed Ollama models.

---

### Chat

```
POST /chat
```

Streams chat responses.

---

### Health Check

```
GET /health
```

Returns backend status.

---

## 💾 Database

SQLite stores:

- Chat Sessions
- Messages
- Creation Time

Database file:

```
chat_history.db
```

